        "note": "low is max(base/2, 1) = max(0, 1) = 1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes": {
    "rounding": "All fee calculations round UP (ceiling). Formula: ceil(x) = (x + divisor - 1) / divisor for integers.",
    "saturation": "All arithmetic uses saturating operations to prevent overflow.",
    "units": "una = smallest unit. 1 DIN = 100,000,000 una. Fee rates in una per virtual byte.",
    "verification": "Run 'cargo test fee' in crates/dpi to validate these vectors against the implementation."
  }
}
